<h3>Multimodal Neural Machine Translation: A Survey of the State of the Art</h3>
Yi Feng, Chuanyi Li, Jiatong He, Zhenyu Hou, and Vincent Ng.
<br>
<i>Proceedings of the 2025 Conference on Empirical Methods in Natural Language Processing</i>, <!-- pp. 28576-28585,--> 2025. 


